  "_readme": [
    "Hand-placed map coordinates for locations Stone Scanner could not resolve.",
    "Most are internal warehouse names ('KLZ', 'BF') that are not places at all;",
    "a few are real towns too small for the bundled city dataset (~15k people+),",
    "e.g. Waite Park, Mechanicsburg PA, Manahawkin.",
    "Fill in lat/lon in decimal degrees, then run: python -m stonescan.geocode --recheck",
    "Keys match the catalog's location text, case-insensitively.",
    "Anything left null stays unmapped and is listed on the /locations page.",
    "Nothing here is guessed for you - a wrong pin is worse than a missing one."
  ],
